report.tests:
`node --test tests/textures.test.js`: 17/17 pass. `npm test` for the whole project: 192/192 pass.

The texture tests cover:
- layer count and size;
- a painter for every registry name, and `paintTexture` matching `generateTextures` layer by layer;
- alpha mode for every layer: opaque all 255, cutout and tint-mask binary, cutouts not empty;
- tint-mask rules: grass top all alpha 0 and grey; grass side fringe 3–6 px deep, grey, with dirt below;
- tinted cutouts grey, and leaf hole share 25–35%;
- water alpha 170–192, ice translucent, crack stages neutral where transparent and growing each stage;
- torch only in columns 7–8, rows 6–15; cactus side opaque in columns 1–14; cactus top with a transparent rim;
- determinism of textures and sky textures;
- no flat stub textures;
- seamless tiling for natural textures;
- water and lava animations loop smoothly;
- mip chain sizes, rules and coverage preservation;
- sky texture sizes, transparency, and cloud coverage and tiling;
- `generateTextures` under 150 ms;
- item sprites have transparent corners and solid bodies;
- icons: green grass top, south face lighter than east, every item non-empty, tinted grass sprite, variant ids map to their base item, other icon sizes work.

Visual checks, all screenshotted and inspected with no page errors:
- `node tools/harness.mjs --url "tools/texture-preview.html?section=...&scale=N&filter=..."` (all sections);
- `tools/texture-scene.html?view=near|far|ground|top`;
- `tools/render-test.html?mesher=real&time=…` (renderer agent's page with my textures).

